{{Term/Store|Speed Up||Series, BotW, TotK}} is a recurring [[Added Effect]] in {{TLoZ Series}}.<ref>{{Cite Guide|BotW Piggyback|page= 280|edition= Expanded Edition|year= 2018}}</ref><ref>{{Cite Guide|TotK Piggyback|page=402-403}}</ref>

==Overview==
In {{BotW}} and {{TotK}}, Speed Up is an [[Added Effect]] that increases [[Link]]'s running speed by 10%, 20%, and 30% for levels one, two, and three respectively, and it has a maximum potency of level three. This Effect also mimics [[Climb Speed Up]] and [[Swim Speed Up]] and stacks with them, although it cannot boost their potency beyond their normal maximum. It does not affect movement speed while [[Skydiving]] in {{TotK|-}}.

The following [[Material]]s grant Speed Up when cooked:
* [[Fleet-Lotus Seeds]]
* [[Rushroom]]
* [[Swift Carrot]]
* [[Swift Violet]]
* [[Hot-Footed Frog]]
* [[Hightail Lizard]]

